ration, so it is recommended to use it when the database is idle.\r\n* Add tests in windows, with worlflow.\r\n", "discussion_url": "https://github.com/orgs/rosedblabs/discussions/223"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108737387", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108737387/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108737387/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/tag/v2.1.0", "id": 108737387, "author": {"login": "roseduan", "id": 22375523, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzc1NTIz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22375523?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan", "html_url": "https://github.com/roseduan", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOEwMicM4GezNr", "tag_name": "v2.1.0", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "Release v2.1.0", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2023-06-15T14:03:26Z", "updated_at": "2023-06-15T14:05:18Z", "published_at": "2023-06-15T14:05:18Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/tarball/v2.1.0", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/zipball/v2.1.0", "body": "## \ud83d\ude80 New Features\r\n\r\n* Support iterator in rosedb, it can traverse the data in database in order.\r\n  And the methods are as follows:\r\n\r\n  * Rewind\r\n  * Seek\r\n  * Next\r\n  * Key\r\n  * Value\r\n  * Close\r\n\r\nAnd the prefix scan is also supported.\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udc1eBug Fix\r\n\r\n* Thanks to @rfyiamcool for PR\r\n  * [#216](https://github.com/rosedblabs/rosedb/pull/216) fix: update committed flag after batch commit\r\n", "discussion_url": "https://github.com/orgs/rosedblabs/discussions/219", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108737387/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "mentions_count": 1}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108382231", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108382231/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/108382231/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/rosedblabs/rosedb/releases/tag/v2.0.0", "id": 108382231, "author": {"login": "roseduan", "id": 22375523, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzc1NTIz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22375523?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan", "html_url": "https://github.com/roseduan", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/roseduan/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.gith